    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055150/extras/2bdc1c5c4e334255bc26ca38853098d4.webp?t=1752528892\" width=754 height=53 /></span>Key Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent, terrifying creatures that stalk your team, learn, and evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A changing, mutating world where the environment itself is your enemy. Each game is unique, with the landscape mutating in different ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative gameplay, where you work with your team to get in, collect scrap, and get out before the environment and creatures grow to monstrous levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannibalize your friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055150/extras/6747104ba08879d2601841fbd4aa1e6a.poster.avif?t=1752528892\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055150/extras/6747104ba08879d2601841fbd4aa1e6a.webm?t=1752528892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055150/extras/6747104ba08879d2601841fbd4aa1e6a.mp4?t=1752528892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055150/extras/2bdc1c5c4e334255bc26ca38853098d4.webp?t=1752528892\" width=754 height=53 /></span>Key Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent, terrifying creatures that stalk your team, learn, and evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A changing, mutating world where the environment itself is your enemy. Each game is unique, with the landscape mutating in different ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative gameplay, where you work with your team to get in, collect scrap, and get out before the environment and creatures grow to monstrous levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannibalize your friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055150/extras/6747104ba08879d2601841fbd4aa1e6a.poster.avif?t=1752528892\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055150/extras/6747104ba08879d2601841fbd4aa1e6a.webm?t=1752528892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055150/extras/6747104ba08879d2601841fbd4aa1e6a.mp4?t=1752528892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
